completed_at: "2026-11-09T11:57:35.291Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: Strict close refusal headline remains bounded and never contains a partial flag token; Default output suppresses generic explanatory filler while structured recovery retains full missing fields and retry arguments; CLI regression verifies no mutation on refusal and actionable close recovery
parent: pm-f05lsg
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: Close refusals use a complete headline and one immediate evidence template. Human domains disclose omissions and the complete SDK context route; JSON budgeting retains truthful receipts without mutating that SDK context.
expected_result: Agents get an actionable concise refusal and accurate recovery when large machine diagnostics reach their declared ceiling.
actual_result: All 74 guidance tests and linked real parser tests pass. A 1000-field diagnostic binds the unchanged 2000-token ceiling while preserving every SDK context value. Retry placement/uniqueness and optional package recovery remain covered. Larger CLI domain restoration remains open in pm-v1kspa; complete CI/re-review is required before merge.
